      },
      "message": "perf(ui): build the stock eye on a worker thread at start\n\nStockEye::new compiles the composite and trace shaders on the UI thread\nbefore the first frame: about 450 ms on a Windows DX12 adapter, with the\nwindow already shown and not answering. Build it on its own thread and\ntake it on a later frame, as the browser shell already does. Until it\nlands, the viewport draws the stock sheet.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
